  npcName: Village Elder
  npcSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a7b9de86dd332fc4eb204ef08c7d734e, type: 3}
  dialogue:
  - Ah, young traveler. I have been waiting for you. Will you stay a while and listen?
  - Thanks! I knew you'd help
  - 'Oh. Okay. '
  - There are six red packets, one in each town. They must all reach the king.  I
    will give you your first one.
  - Seek out the packet in each town. Prove your strength, and they will bestow upon
    you the packet.
  - 'Head to the DOJO first. A ninja must always be prepared.   '
